Tomorrow, I'll be doing a Marshmallow chat stream! Marshmallow Q&A!

1248
01:53:42,176 --> 01:53:48,176
今ね、マシュマロ募集しててね、100個選ぼうと思ってて、
Right now I'm collecting Marshmallows, planning to pick 100,

1249
